+### Dependencies
+- None new.
+
+### Implementation order
+- After section 3 (uses tenant model). Before section 6 (invitations create memberships).
+
+### Acceptance criteria
+- Every authenticated request verified against `tenant_memberships`.
+- Role changes and revocations take effect immediately.
+- Non-owners cannot modify memberships.
